# Place your CSV data files here:
#   Total_score.csv    - Daily sentiment scores (rows=dates, cols=tickers)
#   TW_sentiment.csv   - Taiwan news sentiment (rows=dates, cols=tickers)
#   US_sentiment.csv   - US news sentiment (rows=dates, cols=tickers)
#   Open.csv           - Daily open prices (rows=dates, cols=tickers)
#   Close.csv          - Daily close prices (rows=dates, cols=tickers)
#
# See docs/data_schema.md for full column specifications.
# These files are not committed to git (see .gitignore) due to size.
